# Naming Conventions

Use consistent module naming.

Gameplay modules:

RoundSystem  
InventorySystem  
RewardSystem  

UI modules:

InventoryController  
ShopController  
CrateController  

Configuration modules:

RoundConfig  
ItemConfig  

Utilities:

MathUtils  
TableUtils  

Rules:

Gameplay logic → *System  
UI logic → *Controller  
Configuration → *Config  
Utilities → *Utils